        {
          "text": "P3 recently started learning the local language because of discomfort in daily interactions",
          "evidence": [47]
        },
        {
          "text": "P3 believes B2 level is most often requested, B1 may be acceptable, and listing B2 in a résumé is advisable",
          "evidence": [46]
